      {
        "author_name": "Eric",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104498424660183582615/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVfAMhkiOnsCmrkmQYYliG72TJXSSx1gvKNA-dw3Rk7fzDhOU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I can’t leave a one star review however the lady that works there upsales evertime you walk in. No matter how much you spend there daily it’s like you were there for the first time.\n\nNo greetings, no smile only you want cheeeeze. I stopped going there a year ago because of that. I would spend a lot there.\n\nA dep is supposed to be a local thing where you feel welcomed. The guy that works there is awesome and if I knew his hours I’d likely go back.\n\nSeriously deps have to stop up selling and befriend the patrons. It’s a local thing.\n\nI’ve since gone to the dep down the street. They are super friendly, never charge for a bag and furthermore care. They will actually ask you how your day went. Crazy! Lol.\n\nSo my piece of advice, stop trying to sell cheeZe and become friends with your customers. Especially the ones who show up daily.",
        "time": 1649501178,
        "translated": false
      },
